Local reminder. Law: `AGENTS.md` (also `apps/api/AGENTS.md`).

Prisma stays in `src/modules/*/infra` and shared `src/infra`. Domain and application do not import Express, Fastify, Prisma, React, or BullMQ. JSON uses `{ ok: true, data }` / `{ ok: false, error }`. Tests use in-memory ports.
